        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-4902BM, Ridges at Edge Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ridges at Edge Door Pull is a unique piece for a modern space. Made by RK International, this funky piece will bring an ultra-modern feel to any door. It has a since of movement that is sometimes lost on the sharp lines of modern hardware. It is available in satin nickel, antique english, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. Choose from a 12 inch or an 18 inch center to center. It comes packaged and sold as a pair (2 pulls) with back to back mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Also Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/modern-ridged-door-pull-rk-international-ph-4883\"><b>Modern Ridged Door Through Bolt Mounted Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PH-4902BM</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 13-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PH-4903BM</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 20-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i> Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>",
